{
  "key": 21172,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_MrBacklotOffice",
      "en_US": [
        "Mr. Backlot is the master of this\n",
        "mansion. This is his office."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_ThisWayTrophyGarden",
      "en_US": [
        "This is the way out to the trophy\n",
        "garden.\r",
        "The garden is open for all visitors\n",
        "to enjoy.\r",
        "However, please beware--wild Pokémon\n",
        "may appear in the garden."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_ChallengeFiveMaids",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome.\r",
        "Here, you may challenge the mansion’s\n",
        "pride--the five Trainer maids.\r",
        "The challenge is to beat all five of us\n",
        "in a row without a break.\r",
        "After us, our very own prodigy,\n",
        "Lady Celeste, will battle you.\r",
        "The first time you triumph over her,\n",
        "there will be a special gift.\r",
        "And now...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_TryTheChallenge",
      "en_US": [
        "The 5-Maid Knockout Challenge!\n",
        "Would you like to try?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_HowDisappointing",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, how disappointing...\n",
        "Please take the challenge sometime."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_OurFirstMaid",
      "en_US": [
        "Very well!\n",
        "Our first maid, please!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_DefeatedFourMaids",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations!\n",
        "You have defeated four maids so far.\r",
        "One maid remains, and then\n",
        "Lady Celeste.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_SweptNowCeleste",
      "en_US": [
        "How splendid of you!\n",
        "You swept the five maids!\r",
        "And now, the last of the challenge:\n",
        "our very own prodigy, Lady Celeste!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_TriumphedOverCeleste",
      "en_US": [
        "Your splendor is authentic!\r",
        "Sweeping the floor with the five maids\n",
        "wasn’t enough for you, oh no!\r",
        "Why, to think you would triumph over\n",
        "even our Lady Celeste!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_VisitAgainTomorrow",
      "en_US": "Please visit again tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_StrictlyOffLimits",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m so sorry. Everything beyond this\n",
        "point is strictly off-limits.\r",
        "Please, you really mustn’t.\n",
        "Mr. Backlot will be so cross with me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_Maid1Intro",
      "en_US": [
        "First up! My favorite color is blue!\n",
        "I will open the proceedings!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_Maid1Defeat",
      "en_US": [
        "The next person up is quite strong,\n",
        "really.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_Maid2Intro",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m pleased to meet you in battle.\n",
        "My best color is green!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_Maid2Defeat",
      "en_US": [
        "I was no. 2, and a little bit tough!\n",
        "The next maid is even tougher!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_Maid3Intro",
      "en_US": [
        "My lucky color is yellow!\n",
        "The sunshine girl! That’s me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_Maid3Defeat",
      "en_US": [
        "The next maid is a wee bit stronger\n",
        "than I am.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_Maid4Intro",
      "en_US": [
        "Pink is the color I can’t do without!\n",
        "I’m the fourth in line!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_Maid4Defeat",
      "en_US": "Th-the next maid up is really strong!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_Maid5Intro",
      "en_US": [
        "My symbolic color is red!\n",
        "Prepare for no. 5!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_Maid5Defeat",
      "en_US": [
        "You knocked out the five of us!\n",
        "You have to be splendid!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_CelesteIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, my... You must show me how good\n",
        "you are for the ladies to call me out.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_CelesteDefeat",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, my! My, my, my!\n",
        "Your technique was most enchanting.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_CelesteGift",
      "en_US": [
        "For a first triumph, the house has a\n",
        "gift for you. Please, take this.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_CelesteLeaves",
      "en_US": [
        "I will take my leave now.\n",
        "Giggle...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_KeptYourGift",
      "en_US": [
        "Lady Celeste asked me to keep this\n",
        "for you until you had room.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonMansion_Text_BookTugsAttention",
      "en_US": [
        "The expensive-looking book Mr. Backlot\n",
        "has... It tugs at my attention."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
